{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id321678246"}, "name":{"label":"Mara I."}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-07-29T07:10:24-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.8.3"}, "id":{"label":"8923966388"}, "title":{"label":"Shows less steps than you actually walked"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve downloaded and deleted the app in approximately 5min. I’m not sure why, but when syncing the app with the Health app, it ignored thousands of steps each day in the past. For example, on Sunday I have walked 16.000 steps, but the app only shows 9000 something. I’m glad I stopped as I was about to let the this app write data in my health app, as it would’ve probably erased all my steps in the past. The great thing about this app is that you can add your step count to the Apple Watch face, which is why I downloaded it thinking it will motivate me to walk more. However, ignoring thousands of steps each day, is not going to motivate me at all.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
